-- Round 004-pre (2026-08-22) — REPAIRS + a PRE-REGISTERED de-workaround claim,
-- committed BEFORE the round-004 harness run (round-004.rofl carries the run
-- evidence). Assert-only, never retract.
--
-- REPAIRS — the three engine defects the P0 harness discovered by live probe
-- (round-003 report, discoveredEngineFindings) are FIXED in the engine, each
-- guarded by a regression test that failed before the fix and passes after:
--   F1 negated-wildcard soundness — exec.rs join_derived negated branch now
--      anti-joins existentially over the non-wildcard columns; regression:
--      derive::exec::tests::negated_derived_leg_with_wildcard_is_existential
--      (+ negated_derived_leg_wildcard_arrangements).
--   F2 empty-predicate availability — stratify.rs debug_assert removed
