--      debug-build connection thread → >45s client hang); deadline abort
--      pinned; regressions: derive::exec::tests::
--      unknown_predicate_leg_terminates_with_empty_result and
--      unknown_predicate_leg_expired_deadline_aborts_with_e_exec_001.
--   F3 planner ground-filter false reject — plan.rs shares_no_binding:
--      empty bound set = preceding legs were filters, not a cross-join;
--      regressions: derive::plan::tests::ground_probe_leg_is_safe_in_any_position,
--      negated_novar_leg_first_does_not_reject_generator, and end-to-end
--      derive::exec::tests::ground_fact_probe_filters_in_any_position.
-- The repairs attach to the tier-0 claims because those verdicts previously
-- rested on translator workarounds (aux projection / empty-predicate
-- elimination / ground-literal rejection) that are REMOVED in this round.
repair[a](exp_tier0_differential_green, f1_negated_wildcard_fixed_existential_antijoin_exec_rs).
