repair[a](exp_tier0_witness_green, translator_workarounds_removed_engine_carries_semantics).

-- BENCH-C2 CLASSIFICATION (triage question from _ai/gaps.md, resolved):
-- bench_c2_bulkload's two Io(NotFound) panics were a REAL durable-data-loss
-- bug, NOT environment-specific: ManifestStore::gc_manifests rebuilt
-- referenced_segments from checkpoint snapshots only, dropping segments of
-- post-checkpoint .edit.json commits that the CURRENT published version still
-- references; gc then deleted live segment files. Fixed in
-- storage_v2/manifest.rs (recalc unions self.current's segments + gc_collect
-- current-version guard). Evidence: regression test
-- storage_v2::manifest::tests::test_gc_manifests_recalc_keeps_current_edit_version_segments
-- observed FAILING on pristine f469f785 production code and passing with the
-- fix; bench_c2_bulkload 4/4 across 13 runs. Same flawed loop verified present
-- on main (git show main:.../manifest.rs) — port recommended.
claim_of[a](exp_bench_c2_real_bug_not_env).
ground[a](exp_bench_c2_real_bug_not_env, instrumented_run_gc_manifests_snapshot_only_recalc_dropped_live_segments).
expected[m](exp_bench_c2_real_bug_not_env, real_data_loss_bug_fixed).
evidence[world](exp_bench_c2_real_bug_not_env, cargo_regression_test_gc_manifests_recalc_fail_before_pass_after).
evidence[world](exp_bench_c2_real_bug_not_env, bench_c2_bulkload_4_of_4_across_13_runs).
found[m](exp_bench_c2_real_bug_not_env, real_data_loss_bug_fixed).

